  "description": "FsCheck.Xunit integrates FsCheck with xUnit.NET by adding a PropertyAttribute that runs FsCheck tests, similar to xUnit.NET's FactAttribute.\n\n            All the options normally available in vanilla FsCheck via configuration can be controlled via the PropertyAttribute.",
